From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 12:53:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] squash! ports/arkweb: restrict libservo_arkweb.so exported
 symbols and load it with RTLD_LOCAL

Rebase ohos-patches/0001 onto OpenHarmony-v7.0-Release (web_webview
12cb9a37bbba) to match the re-synced NWeb headers. Only the context and
line numbers change; the patch content is the same. It targets this
patch because this is the last one in the stack that edits 0001.

Validation: Built a full rk3568 arm64 image from OpenHarmony-v7.0-Release with ohos-patches/0001 and 0002 applied (without 0002 it boot-loops on appspawn) and flashed a HiHope DAYU200 (OpenHarmony 7.0, API 26); `./mach build --ohos --release --no-package -p arkweb`, deployed with `tools/deploy.py`, test app installed with `tools/build_test_app.py`; `HDC_TARGET=<serial> uv run --with pytest --with hdc-py --with pillow python -m pytest ports/arkweb/tools`: 35 passed, 1 xfailed. `tools/gen_stubs.py --check` is clean.
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; patch rebase and on-device testing)
Signed-off-by: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
---
 .../0001-webview-servo-engine-backend.patch        | 14 +++++++-------
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ports/arkweb/ohos-patches/0001-webview-servo-engine-backend.patch b/ports/arkweb/ohos-patches/0001-webview-servo-engine-backend.patch
